<div class="phead"><div class="w"><ol class="crumbs"><li><a href="{{ PathBase }}/">Home</a></li><li>Divisions</li></ol><div class="g"><span class="num">I</span><div><p class="kick">Three divisions, one hill</p><h1>Lower, Middle and Upper School</h1></div></div><p class="lede">Each division has its own building, head and day. They share the library, dining hall, houses and the walled garden.</p></div></div><section class="sec tight" style="padding-bottom:70px"><div class="w"><div class="divs">{% for d in Target.Items %}{%- assign y=d.PublishedContent -%}{%- capture dc -%}{{ y.color }}{%- endcapture -%}<a class="dv" href="{{ PathBase }}/{{ d.RoutePath }}" style="--c:{{ dc }}"><img src="{{ y.art.Value | attachment_redirect_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"><div class="b"><span class="gr">{{ y.grades }} · ages {{ y.ages }}</span><h3>{{ d.PrimaryField }}</h3><p>{{ y.summary }}</p><div class="facts"><div><b>{{ y.students }}</b>students</div><div><b>{{ y.class_size }}</b>avg. class</div><div><b style="font-size:1rem;line-height:1.35">{{ y.head }}</b>division head</div></div></div></a>{% endfor %}</div></div></section>
